flowchart TD
    A["命令回复完成"]
    B["更新 last_interaction / stats"]
    C{"buffer 还有完整命令？"}
    D["继续 ParseLoop / ExecuteBatch"]
    E{"已有 pending command<br/>或控制消息？"}
    F["继续 drain queue"]
    G["FlushReplies"]
    H["Read/Recv 或 io_event.await"]
    I{"收到数据？"}
    J["追加到 io_buf_，回到 parse"]
    K["EOF / error / close request"]

    A --> B --> C
    C -->|是| D --> A
    C -->|否| E
    E -->|是| F --> A
    E -->|否| G --> H --> I
    I -->|是| J --> D
    I -->|否| K
